description: "K definition:\n\nmodule MAIN\n  syntax Id ::= r\"[a-z]\" [token]\n  syntax Ids ::= List{Id, \",\"} [symbol(ids)]\n  syntax Wrapped ::= \"wrap\" Ids [symbol(wrap)]\n  rule wrap a => wrap a,b\nendmodule\n"
---
